# The initializers of the fields of a class are a function of their own, which no trace shows. It is code of a file all the same: a host function that asks for the file of its caller gets that file. It asked the frames that a trace shows, so the constructor answered: one that is written lies in the same file, one that nobody wrote has no file, and the answer was null. A constructor that nobody wrote goes on answering that it has no file, as it answers in the interpreter.
